## Limited personal sideload permission

The copyright holder grants you a non-exclusive, non-transferable permission
to download and install official APK binaries published by the copyright
holder in this GitHub repository, solely for your own personal, non-commercial
use on devices you own or control.

This permission applies only to those official APK binaries. It does not grant
permission to redistribute, mirror, repackage, modify, or commercially use
the software, nor to publish it through an app store. Any other use requires
separate written permission from the copyright holder. Public access to the
source code on GitHub does not grant additional rights to use or redistribute
the source.

Official APKs are debug-signed and are not production- or Play Store-ready.
Android accepts an update only when it is signed with the same certificate as
the installed app. The copyright holder does not guarantee that future APKs
will remain compatible with an earlier debug signing key. Uninstalling an app
to change signing keys can erase its local data.

See docs/legal/medical-disclaimer.md:
Glucose For Watch is not a certified medical device.
